{"id":"665234","name":"玉米面馒头","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/665234/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"中筋面粉","amount":"350克"},{"name":"细玉米面","amount":"150克"},{"name":"开水","amount":"120克（100度）"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"糖","amount":"30克（根据自己喜好调整）"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"5克"}],"sub":[{"name":"猪油","amount":"15克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"克玉米面用120克的开水烫面。","img":"images/665234/step_1.png"},{"step":2,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/665234/step_2.png"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入糖，再次搅拌均匀。","img":"images/665234/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"磕入两个鸡蛋。","img":"images/665234/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入350克面粉。","img":"images/665234/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"酵母5克。","img":"images/665234/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搅拌成有大面絮。","img":"images/665234/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入15克猪油，再次搅拌均匀。","img":"images/665234/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"下手揉成一个光滑的面团。","img":"images/665234/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"切成均匀的小剂子（70克左右一个）。","img":"images/665234/step_10.png"},{"step":11,"desc":"分别团成圆形。","img":"images/665234/step_11.png"},{"step":12,"desc":"摆入蒸锅，中间留出空隙，盖上锅盖，放温暖处发酵至两倍大（现在温度高，40分钟左右）。","img":"images/665234/step_12.png"},{"step":13,"desc":"发酵好的馒头，凉水上锅，出汽后蒸12～15分钟，再虚蒸3分钟就好了。","img":"images/665234/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"出锅了。","img":"images/665234/step_14.png"},{"step":15,"desc":"蓬松暄软，组织细腻。","img":"images/665234/step_15.png"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品图来一张。","img":"images/665234/step_16.png"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}